@startuml
title Resumefolio | Specification review roadmap
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Use accepted scope, constraints and actual elicitation sources;
:Review proposed user and YAML / CI-CD specification records;
:Resolve affected behavior, permission, lifecycle and target questions;
:Investigate decisive provider / resource / execution dependencies early;
:Reconcile SRS, domains, dictionary, scenarios and final identifiers;
:Record actual traceability, review findings and unresolved blockers;
if (Baseline criteria satisfied for an identified candidate?) then (yes)
 :Seek and record actual owner baseline disposition; <<#DCFCE7>>
else (pending / unmet)
 :Record gap, owner and dependent gate;
 :Revise affected records and review again; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
stop
legend bottom
Current M-02 baseline remains pending; this is a review roadmap.
Documentation checks are not product verification or provider approval.
The wider pre-implementation agreement still precedes product coding.
endlegend
@enduml
